<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>EVM Technology | Aura</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@300;400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        /* MEDICAL THEME VARIABLES */
        :root {
            --primary: #059669;       /* Emerald Green */
            --primary-dark: #064e3b;  /* Deep Forest */
            --primary-light: #d1fae5; /* Mint wash */
            --accent: #f97316;        /* Bright Orange */
            --bg-white: #ffffff;
            --bg-offwhite: #f8fafc;
            --text-dark: #1e293b;
            --text-light: #64748b;
        }

        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif; }

        body {
            background-color: var(--bg-white);
            color: var(--text-dark);
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        /* BETA BADGE */
        .beta-badge {
            position: fixed;
            top: 20px;
            right: 20px;
            background: var(--accent);
            color: white;
            padding: 6px 16px;
            border-radius: 50px;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            z-index: 1000;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.2);
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }

        /* NAVIGATION */
        nav {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 1.5rem 5%;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 100;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
        }

        .brand { font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--primary-dark); text-decoration: none; }
        .brand span { color: var(--accent); }
        .back-link { text-decoration: none; color: var(--text-light); font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.9rem; transition: 0.3s; }
        .back-link:hover { color: var(--primary); }

        /* CONTENT SECTION */
        .page-header {
            padding: 6rem 5% 4rem;
            text-align: center;
            background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, var(--primary-light) 0%, white 70%);
        }

        .tag {
            background: rgba(5, 150, 105, 0.1);
            color: var(--primary);
            padding: 6px 12px;
            border-radius: 50px;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            display: inline-block;
        }

        h1 { font-size: 3.5rem; color: var(--primary-dark); margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
        .subtitle { font-size: 1.25rem; color: var(--text-light); max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; }

        .detail-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 4rem;
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 4rem auto;
            padding: 0 5% 6rem;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .visual-container {
            background: var(--bg-offwhite);
            height: 450px;
            border-radius: 24px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .visual-icon { font-size: 5rem; z-index: 2; }
        
        /* Pulse Animation to simulate EVM */
        .pulse-ring {
            position: absolute;
            width: 200px;
            height: 200px;
            border: 2px solid var(--primary);
            border-radius: 50%;
            animation: ripple 2s infinite ease-out;
            opacity: 0;
        }

        @keyframes ripple {
            0% { transform: scale(0.8); opacity: 0.5; }
            100% { transform: scale(1.5); opacity: 0; }
        }

        .tech-content h2 { font-size: 2.2rem; color: var(--primary-dark); margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
        .tech-content p { color: var(--text-light); font-size: 1.1rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; }

        .feature-list { list-style: none; }
        .feature-list li {
            margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
            padding-left: 35px;
            position: relative;
            color: var(--text-dark);
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        .feature-list li::before {
            content: "→";
            position: absolute;
            left: 0;
            color: var(--accent);
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        /* FOOTER */
        footer {
            background-color: #f1f5f9;
            color: var(--text-light);
            text-align: center;
            padding: 3rem 5%;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
        }
        footer a { color: var(--primary); text-decoration: none; }

        @media (max-width: 968px) {
            .detail-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 2rem; }
            h1 { font-size: 2.5rem; }
            .visual-container { height: 300px; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="beta-badge">BETA v0.8</div>

    <nav>
        <a href="index.html" class="brand">Aura<span>.</span></a>
        <a href="index.html" class="back-link">← Back to Overview</a>
    </nav>

    <section class="page-header">
        <span class="tag">Vision Intelligence</span>
        <h1>Eulerian Video Magnification</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">Our core computer vision engine that amplifies subtle physiological changes invisible to the naked eye.</p>
    </section>

    <div class="detail-grid">
        <div class="visual-container">
            <div class="pulse-ring"></div>
            <div class="visual-icon">👁️</div>
            <p style="margin-top: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--primary);">Real-time rPPG Signal Processing</p>
        </div>

        <div class="tech-content">
            <h2>Making the Pulse Visible</h2>
            <p>
                Aura's EVM technology acts as a "microscope for video." By applying spatial decomposition and temporal filtering, we amplify the tiny color variations in skin tissue caused by the cardiac cycle.
            </p>
            
            <ul class="feature-list">
                <li><strong>Remote Photoplethysmography (rPPG):</strong> Extracting heart rate, SpO2, and HRV without a single physical sensor.</li>
                <li><strong>Motion Magnification:</strong> Amplifying chest movements to track respiratory rates in neonatal environments.</li>
                <li><strong>Edge Processing:</strong> Our algorithms run locally on the Aura Hub to ensure zero-latency alerts and total data privacy.</li>
                <li><strong>Adaptive Filtering:</strong> Sophisticated AI that filters out ambient light noise and movement artifacts.</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>

    <section style="padding: 4rem 5%; text-align: center; background: var(--primary-dark); color: white;">
        <h2 style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">Ready to see the unseen?</h2>
        <p style="margin-bottom: 2rem; opacity: 0.8;">The EVM module is currently in clinical testing for NICU integration.</p>
        <a href="index.html#solutions" class="back-link" style="color: var(--accent); border: 1px solid var(--accent); padding: 10px 25px; border-radius: 50px;">View Case Studies</a>
    </section>

    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2026 Aura Health. A <a href="../../index.html">Shoonya Origins</a> Company.</p>
        <p style="margin-top: 10px; font-size: 0.8rem;">Pune, India | Contact: sentinel@shoonya.com</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
